  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen you hover over the Groups listed on the left side of the Groups Tab you will notice a small little hover effect, this effect looks a it broken currently.\n\n1. Group Icons don't have an outline \n\n2. Public / Private Text does not move to the right like the Name does.\n\n3. You can see the outline extending to the side of the image (Attachment 2.)\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\n1. The Group Icon should have a outline on hover, just like it does when you have a Group selected.\n\n2. The Public / Private Text should move to the right on hover, just like the Name does. (World Favorites also do this btw)\n\n3. Just don't make it do that xD\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere are pictures showcasing the issues:",
